TEST 06_minimal_nucre — 150 MeV protons in water, nuclear reactions enabled
21.05.2026 / Niels Bassler

Same geometry and beam as 00_minimal but with NUCRE 1 in beam.dat.
Primary fluence should decrease monotonically with depth as primaries are
removed by nuclear reactions (Tripathi cross section).

Run:
  build_rel/bin/openshieldhit -v tests/cases/06_minimal_nucre/

Plot comparison with 00_minimal:
  python3 tools/plot_nucre.py
